{"c":[{"id":"29530a97880a269e660dbdfe6943053f229dc80d93cafa9e9c7e269e0e3077e7","sum":"tox is the pytest suite on CPython 3.11–3.14 (no 3.10; no test-result cache unless proven on this tmp_path/worktree suite); recall matches nested nap captions; zoom/recall print 'skipped a pack' on stderr for an unreadable sibling children file; wake stays silent","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T034719Z-9ead1d6adb1f23f2","text":"Niko L2 tox-pytest-runner: one tox command for pytest on CPython 3.11–3.14 (no 3.10); skip test-result cache unless proven on this tmp_path/worktree suite","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T035449Z-38690d9f52484de6","text":"recall matches nested NapChild.sum captions; zoom/recall print 'skipped a pack' on stderr when they skip an unreadable sibling children file; wake stays silent","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"1cd145ba45ef49e6f3e7ca4db21d5e5f372f7e8b3109cdcf8637f9501cb76952","sum":"tox is the suite (py311-py314, no result cache). Files the script writes are part of the work: git-add them; the script is the only writer.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T040400Z-6f72c4e24f7307a3","text":"tox is the suite command: tox.ini package=skip, py311-py314, no test-result cache; 211 pytest. This uv only had 3.14.0rc3.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T044725Z-82b67eae5e042401","text":"After note or nap, git add the files the script wrote and commit them; the script stays the only writer.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
